---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import { SITE, withBase } from "../site.config";
---

<PageLayout title={`关于 — ${SITE.author}`} description="关于 Justice。">
  <header class="flex items-center gap-5 border-b border-border pb-8">
    <img src={withBase(SITE.avatar)} alt="Justice 的头像" class="h-24 w-24 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover" />
    <div>
      <h1 class="page-title">Justice</h1>
      <a href={SITE.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-2 inline-block text-sm text-link">GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="max-w-2xl space-y-5 py-8 text-sm leading-7 text-muted" aria-label="自述">
    <p>HITSZ计科在读，爱折腾电脑硬件。</p>
    <p>为什么开这个博客，我也说不出什么特别的理由。没有固定主题，想到什么能写就写什么。</p>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
